@page "/guides/reconnection"
@using AtomBlazor.Icons.Lucide

<PageTitle>@L.T("重连 - Atom BlazorUI", "Reconnection - Atom BlazorUI")</PageTitle>

<div class="max-w-4xl space-y-8">
    <div class="space-y-3">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">@L.T("重连", "Reconnection")</h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-muted-foreground">
            @L.T("只需把一段标记粘贴进宿主页面，Blazor Server 的重连对话框就会跟随你的主题，而不是显示框架那个素白的方框。", "Paste one block into your host page and the Blazor Server reconnection dialog follows your theme instead of showing the framework's plain white box.")
        </p>
    </div>

    <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">@L.T("试一试", "Try it")</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
            @L.T("这些按钮把真实对话框切到框架能够设置的每个状态。没有任何模拟 —— 这里的标记和 CSS 就是你的应用会原样发布的那份。", "These buttons put the real dialog into each state the framework can set. Nothing is simulated — the markup and the CSS are the ones your application would ship.")
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <Button Variant="ButtonVariant.Outline" Size="ButtonSize.Small" OnClick="@(() => Preview("components-reconnect-show"))">@L.T("重连中", "Reconnecting")</Button>
            <Button Variant="ButtonVariant.Outline" Size="ButtonSize.Small" OnClick="@(() => Preview("components-reconnect-show components-reconnect-retrying"))">@L.T("倒计时中", "Counting down")</Button>
            <Button Variant="ButtonVariant.Outline" Size="ButtonSize.Small" OnClick="@(() => Preview("components-reconnect-paused"))">@L.T("已暂停", "Paused")</Button>
            <Button Variant="ButtonVariant.Outline" Size="ButtonSize.Small" OnClick="@(() => Preview("components-reconnect-failed"))">@L.T("失败", "Failed")</Button>
            <Button Variant="ButtonVariant.Outline" Size="ButtonSize.Small" OnClick="@(() => Preview("components-reconnect-rejected"))">@L.T("被拒绝", "Rejected")</Button>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-r-lg border-s-4 border-primary bg-primary/5 p-4">
            @if (L.IsChinese)
            {
                <text>
                    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                        每个预览会在十二秒后自行清除。<strong class="text-foreground">失败</strong>
                        与 <strong class="text-foreground">被拒绝</strong> 状态带有可用的按钮 —— 重新加载真的会重新加载页面。
                    </p>
                </text>
            }
            else
            {
                <text>
                    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                        Each preview clears itself after twelve seconds. The <strong class="text-foreground">Failed</strong>
                        and <strong class="text-foreground">Rejected</strong> states carry working buttons —
                        Reload really does reload.
                    </p>
                </text>
            }
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">@L.T("为什么计数大约从 11 开始", "Why the counter starts around 11")</h2>
        @if (L.IsChinese)
        {
            <text>
                <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    它没有跳过尝试。Blazor 的默认策略是
                    <strong class="text-foreground">前十次完全无间隔地重试</strong>，然后在第 11 到 20 次之间每次等待五秒，
                    之后直到三十次上限每次等待三十秒。前十次在几百毫秒内就过去了 —— 远快到人眼能读到的程度 —— 所以
                    一个人真正看到的第一个数字是 11。
                </p>
            </text>
        }
        else
        {
            <text>
                <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    It is not skipping attempts. Blazor's default policy retries
                    <strong class="text-foreground">ten times with no gap at all</strong>, then waits five
                    seconds between attempts 11 and 20, then thirty seconds up to the limit of thirty. The
                    first ten are over in a few hundred milliseconds — far faster than anyone can read — so
                    the first number a person actually sees is 11.
                </p>
            </text>
        }
        @if (L.IsChinese)
        {
            <text>
                <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    这也是倒计时只从第 11 次开始出现的原因。间隔为零时没什么可倒数的，框架只有在存在
                    真实等待时才会加上
                    <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">components-reconnect-retrying</code>
                    。启动 Blazor 时可通过
                    <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">reconnectionOptions.retryIntervalMilliseconds</code>
                    和 <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">maxRetries</code> 修改这一切。
                </p>
            </text>
        }
        else
        {
            <text>
                <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    That is also why the countdown only appears from attempt 11. While the gap is zero there
                    is nothing to count, and the framework only adds
                    <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">components-reconnect-retrying</code>
                    once there is a real wait. Change any of it with
                    <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">reconnectionOptions.retryIntervalMilliseconds</code>
                    and <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">maxRetries</code> when you start Blazor.
                </p>
            </text>
        }
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">@L.T("为什么它是标记而不是组件", "Why it is markup and not a component")</h2>
        @if (L.IsChinese)
        {
            <text>
                <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    对话框出现在电路断开的时候，所以按定义此时什么组件都无法渲染。Blazor 由
                    宿主页面的静态 HTML 驱动它：给页面一个
                    <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">id="components-reconnect-modal"</code>
                    的元素，框架就会在其上切换状态类。没有这样的元素时，它会自建遮罩并注入自己的样式表 —— 那就是多数 Server 应用自带的无样式方框。
                </p>
            </text>
        }
        else
        {
            <text>
                <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    The dialog appears when the circuit is down, so by definition nothing can render. Blazor
                    drives it from static HTML in the host page: give the page an element with
                    <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">id="components-reconnect-modal"</code>
                    and the framework toggles state classes on it. With no such element it builds its own
                    overlay and injects its own stylesheet, which is the unstyled box most Server
                    applications ship with.
                </p>
            </text>
        }
        @if (L.IsChinese)
        {
            <text>
                <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    样式位于 <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">.css</code>
                    中并读取你的主题变量，因此浅色与深色模式都无需配置。
                </p>
            </text>
        }
        else
        {
            <text>
                <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    The styling is in <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">.css</code>
                    and reads your theme variables, so light and dark need no configuration.
                </p>
            </text>
        }
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">@L.T("配置", "Setup")</h2>
        @if (L.IsChinese)
        {
            <text>
                <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    把这段粘贴进 <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">App.razor</code>
                    （或 <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">index.html</code>）的
                    <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">&lt;body&gt;</code> 内。这个演示用的就是同一段。
                </p>
            </text>
        }
        else
        {
            <text>
                <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    Paste this into <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">App.razor</code>
                    (or <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">index.html</code>) inside
                    <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">&lt;body&gt;</code>. It is the same
                    block this demo uses.
                </p>
            </text>
        }
        <CodeBlock Source="Guides/Reconnection/markup.txt" />
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">@L.T("状态", "States")</h2>
        @if (L.IsChinese)
        {
            <text>
                <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    框架会在 modal 元素上设置这些类。带有
                    <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">data-when</code> 的元素只在其列出的状态中出现，因此一段标记即可服务全部状态。
                </p>
            </text>
        }
        else
        {
            <text>
                <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    The framework sets these classes on the modal element. An element carrying
                    <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">data-when</code> shows only in the
                    states it lists, so one block of markup serves all of them.
                </p>
            </text>
        }
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg border">
            <table class="w-full text-sm">
                <thead class="bg-muted/50">
                    <tr>
                        <th class="p-3 text-start font-medium">@L.T("类名", "Class")</th>
                        <th class="p-3 text-start font-medium">@L.T("出现时机", "When")</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr class="border-t"><td class="p-3 font-mono text-xs">components-reconnect-show</td><td class="p-3 text-muted-foreground">@L.T("正在尝试重连。", "Trying to reconnect.")</td></tr>
                    <tr class="border-t"><td class="p-3 font-mono text-xs">components-reconnect-retrying</td><td class="p-3 text-muted-foreground">@if (L.IsChinese)
                        {
                            <text>
                                在倒计时到下一次尝试期间，叠加在 <code class="text-xs">show</code> 之上。
                            </text>
                        }
                        else
                        {
                            <text>
                                Added on top of <code class="text-xs">show</code> while counting down to the next attempt.
                            </text>
                        }</td></tr>
                    <tr class="border-t"><td class="p-3 font-mono text-xs">components-reconnect-paused</td><td class="p-3 text-muted-foreground">@L.T("电路被暂停，将自行恢复。", "The circuit was paused and will resume on its own.")</td></tr>
                    <tr class="border-t"><td class="p-3 font-mono text-xs">components-reconnect-hide</td><td class="p-3 text-muted-foreground">@L.T("已重连，对话框消失。", "Reconnected. The dialog goes away.")</td></tr>
                    <tr class="border-t"><td class="p-3 font-mono text-xs">components-reconnect-failed</td><td class="p-3 text-muted-foreground">@if (L.IsChinese)
                        {
                            <text>
                                重试次数用尽。<code class="text-xs">Blazor.reconnect()</code> 会再试一次。
                            </text>
                        }
                        else
                        {
                            <text>
                                Out of attempts. <code class="text-xs">Blazor.reconnect()</code> tries again.
                            </text>
                        }</td></tr>
                    <tr class="border-t"><td class="p-3 font-mono text-xs">components-reconnect-resume-failed</td><td class="p-3 text-muted-foreground">@L.T("被暂停的电路无法恢复。", "A paused circuit could not be resumed.")</td></tr>
                    <tr class="border-t"><td class="p-3 font-mono text-xs">components-reconnect-rejected</td><td class="p-3 text-muted-foreground">@L.T("服务器拒绝了会话，只有重新加载有用。", "The server refused the session. Only a reload helps.")</td></tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
        @if (L.IsChinese)
        {
            <text>
                <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    Blazor 还会填充 <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">#components-reconnect-current-attempt</code>、
                    <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">#components-reconnect-max-retries</code> 和
                    <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">#components-seconds-to-next-attempt</code>。
                    每个 id 只应出现一次 —— 框架按 id 查找它们，并且只取第一个。
                </p>
            </text>
        }
        else
        {
            <text>
                <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    Blazor also fills <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">#components-reconnect-current-attempt</code>,
                    <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">#components-reconnect-max-retries</code> and
                    <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">#components-seconds-to-next-attempt</code>.
                    Each id may appear only once — the framework looks them up by id and takes the first.
                </p>
            </text>
        }
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">@L.T("覆盖它", "Overriding it")</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
            @L.T("标记由你掌管，因此以下四种做法都可行：", "The markup is yours, so all four of these work:")
        </p>
        <ul class="ms-4 list-disc space-y-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
            <li>@if (L.IsChinese)
                {
                    <text>
                        <strong class="text-foreground">什么都不改。</strong>每一种颜色都来自主题变量，所以它在两种模式下已经与你的应用相匹配。
                    </text>
                }
                else
                {
                    <text>
                        <strong class="text-foreground">Change nothing.</strong> Every colour comes from a theme variable, so it already matches your application in both modes.
                    </text>
                }</li>
            <li>@if (L.IsChinese)
                {
                    <text>
                        <strong class="text-foreground">加上你自己的类。</strong>库的规则位于 <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">components</code> 级联层，排在你的工具类之下，因此你的类无需 <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">!important</code> 就能胜出。
                    </text>
                }
                else
                {
                    <text>
                        <strong class="text-foreground">Add your own classes.</strong> The library's rules live in the <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">components</code> cascade layer, below your utilities, so your classes win without <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">!important</code>.
                    </text>
                }</li>
            <li>@if (L.IsChinese)
                {
                    <text>
                        <strong class="text-foreground">写不同的标记。</strong>任何带有该 id 的元素都能用；上面那段只是一个起点。
                    </text>
                }
                else
                {
                    <text>
                        <strong class="text-foreground">Write different markup.</strong> Any element with that id works; the block above is only a starting point.
                    </text>
                }</li>
            <li>@if (L.IsChinese)
                {
                    <text>
                        <strong class="text-foreground">让 Blazor 指向别处。</strong>启动 Blazor 时设置 <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">reconnectionOptions.dialogId</code>，库的 CSS 就永远不会匹配到。
                    </text>
                }
                else
                {
                    <text>
                        <strong class="text-foreground">Point Blazor elsewhere.</strong> Set <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">reconnectionOptions.dialogId</code> when you start Blazor and the library's CSS never matches.
                    </text>
                }</li>
        </ul>
    </section>
</div>

@code {
    [Inject] private IJSRuntime JS { get; set; } = default!;

    /// <summary>显示语言快照（MainLayout 级联下发；缺省回落中文）。</summary>
    [CascadingParameter] public DemoCultureState L { get; set; } = DemoCultureState.Default;

    private async Task Preview(string classes)
    {
        // The countdown ticks here the way the framework ticks it -- once a second -- so the
        // preview shows the real behaviour rather than a number frozen at 5.
        #pragma warning disable BL0016 // （.NET 11 Razor 分析器）照本体保留无 try/catch 守卫的 JS 调用，系重连对话框演示 Preview() 一次性触发、非交互期必可达；采定点抑制
        await JS.InvokeVoidAsync("eval", $$"""
            (() => {
                const m = document.getElementById('components-reconnect-modal');
                if (!m) return;
                clearInterval(window.__bbReconnectPreview);
                const set = (id, v) => { const el = document.getElementById(id); if (el) el.innerText = v; };
                set('components-reconnect-current-attempt', '12');
                set('components-reconnect-max-retries', '30');
                m.className = '{{classes}}';

                if (m.classList.contains('components-reconnect-retrying')) {
                    let secs = 5;
                    let attempt = 12;
                    set('components-seconds-to-next-attempt', secs);
                    window.__bbReconnectPreview = setInterval(() => {
                        secs -= 1;
                        if (secs < 1) { secs = 5; attempt += 1; set('components-reconnect-current-attempt', attempt); }
                        set('components-seconds-to-next-attempt', secs);
                    }, 1000);
                }

                setTimeout(() => {
                    clearInterval(window.__bbReconnectPreview);
                    m.className = '';
                }, 12000);
            })();
            """);
        #pragma warning restore BL0016
    }
}
